# Deny-by-default. This repo publishes to GitHub Pages, so ONLY the files
# that are meant to be public may ever be committed.
#
# Everything else in this folder — the unencrypted Lake_Garda_Trip_Plan.html,
# the PDF, every planning note — stays local.
# Do not add exceptions without thinking about who can read the repo.
/*

!.gitignore
!index.html
!robots.txt

# Offline support, added 2026-09-05. All public by nature: caching logic,
# an app manifest naming the page "Private page", and an anonymous padlock
# icon. None of them mention the trip.
!sw.js
!manifest.webmanifest
!icon-180.png
!icon-192.png
!icon-512.png
